DL(){return new A.mr("Privacy policy",A.b([B.n7,new A.bW("At a glance","Ahead is built so that only you can read your financial data. Transactions, budgets, portfolio and savings goals are stored on your device. With an account we also keep a copy that is encrypted on your device with your password before upload: we cannot read it. Other data only leaves your device when you use a feature that needs it, such as the bank connection or Buddy. We show no ads, use no tracking and sell no data.\n\nAs of: Oktober 2026"),new A.bW("1. Controller",A.bHa()),B.a8a,B.a8t,B.a7T,B.a8y,B.a8p,B.a82,B.a8b,B.a88,B.a87,new A.bW("10. Your rights","You have the right of access (Art. 15 GDPR), rectification (Art. 16), erasure (Art. 17), restriction of processing (Art. 18), data portability (Art. 20) and objection (Art. 21). You can withdraw consent at any time. Much of this works directly in the app: export data, change or delete your account, disconnect the bank. For everything else write to luis.frenkler@t-online.de.\n\nYou can also complain to a data protection supervisory authority, for example Der Hamburgische Beauftragte f\xfcr Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit, Ludwig-Erhard-Str. 22, 20459 Hamburg.")],t.J8))},
